---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Vision | GlobSol Power Pvt Ltd"
  description="Becoming the Customer's Most Valued Service Provider and Leading the Nation Towards Renewable Energy."
>
  <section class="page-banner-section pt-130 pb-80" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e73be 0%, #0d4b82 100%);">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-lg-12 text-center text-white">
          <span class="text-white-50 text-uppercase fw-bold tracking-wider">About Us</span>
          <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold text-white mt-2 mb-3">Our Vision</h1>
          <p class="lead max-w-xl mx-auto opacity-90" style="max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto;">
            "Becoming the Customer's Most Valued Service Provider and Leading the Nation Towards Renewable Energy"
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-5 bg-white">
    <div class="container py-4">
      <div class="row justify-content-center">
        <div class="col-lg-10">
          <div class="p-4 p-md-5 rounded-4 shadow-sm bg-light mb-5">
            <h3 class="h4 fw-bold text-primary mb-4">Unpacking Our Vision</h3>
            <div class="row g-4">
              <div class="col-md-6">
                <div class="p-3 bg-white rounded-3 border">
                  <h4 class="h5 fw-bold mb-2 text-dark">1. Customer-Centric Excellence</h4>
                  <p class="text-secondary mb-0">We aspire to be more than a service provider; we aim to become an integral partner in our customers' success. By consistently delivering exceptional services, personalized solutions, and unparalleled support, we seek to earn the distinction of being our customers' most valued ally.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="col-md-6">
                <div class="p-3 bg-white rounded-3 border">
                  <h4 class="h5 fw-bold mb-2 text-dark">2. Driving Renewable Energy Adoption</h4>
                  <p class="text-secondary mb-0">Our vision extends beyond traditional service boundaries. We are committed to playing a pivotal role in driving the nation towards renewable energy solutions. Through innovation, advocacy, and sustainable practices, we aim to contribute significantly to a greener future.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <h3 class="h4 fw-bold mb-4">Guiding Principles</h3>
          <div class="row g-4 mb-5">
            <div class="col-md-6">
              <div class="d-flex gap-3">
                <div class="flex-shrink-0 text-primary fs-3"><i class="lni lni-bulb"></i></div>
                <div>
                  <h5 class="fw-bold mb-1">Innovation at the Core</h5>
                  <p class="text-secondary fs-6">We continuously seek innovative solutions that align with our customers' evolving needs and drive advancements in the renewable energy sector.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6">
              <div class="d-flex gap-3">
                <div class="flex-shrink-0 text-primary fs-3"><i class="lni lni-leaf"></i></div>
                <div>
                  <h5 class="fw-bold mb-1">Sustainability as a Commitment</h5>
                  <p class="text-secondary fs-6">From energy-efficient practices to eco-friendly initiatives, we strive to set a standard for environmental responsibility.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6">
              <div class="d-flex gap-3">
                <div class="flex-shrink-0 text-primary fs-3"><i class="lni lni-users"></i></div>
                <div>
                  <h5 class="fw-bold mb-1">Collaboration for Impact</h5>
                  <p class="text-secondary fs-6">We actively partner with stakeholders, customers, and the community to create a collective impact that propels sustainable energy forward.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6">
              <div class="d-flex gap-3">
                <div class="flex-shrink-0 text-primary fs-3"><i class="lni lni-stats-up"></i></div>
                <div>
                  <h5 class="fw-bold mb-1">Continuous Improvement</h5>
                  <p class="text-secondary fs-6">We are dedicated to a culture of continuous improvement, consistently refining our processes and enhancing our offerings.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 rounded-3 text-center text-white" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3763eb 0%, #6f58e8 100%);">
            <p class="fs-5 mb-0 fw-medium">Join us on this visionary quest at GlobSol, where we are not just shaping a future of customer-centric excellence but also leading the charge towards a sustainable nation.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
